items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Grapple.name = Grappling hook
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Grapple.description = Right click: the hook bites into the rock you aim at (32 blocks) and pulls you to it. One charge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Parachute.name = Parachute
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Parachute.description = Right click in the air: glide down where you look. Crouch to close it. One charge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Powder.name = Black powder charge
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Powder.description = Right click: the blast throws you far ahead, with no fall damage. One charge.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Flare.name = Flare
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Flare.description = Right click: the flare lights up the rock it hits.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Bounce_Cap.name = Bouncing mushroom
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Bounce_Cap.description = Jump on it: it sends you flying.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Leftover_Supplies.name = Leftover supplies
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Leftover_Supplies.description = Use: refill your survey gear.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Zipline_Anchor.name = Zip line anchor
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Zipline_Anchor.description = Use: ride the zip line. Crouch to let go.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Wind_Cannon.name = Wind cannon
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Wind_Cannon.description = Use: the wind carries you.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Mark.name = Survey mark
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Survey_Mark.description = A white circle of the Luxon surveyors: checkpoint.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Flare_Light.name = Flare light
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Flare_Light.description = The light of a flare.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_1.name = Torn logbook page
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_1.description = Third day beneath the jade sea. Dolus says the crevasse runs down to the heart of the Surf. Thess has strung the first ropes; the crew dislikes the silence down here.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_2.name = A deckhand's notebook
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_2.description = The purple mushrooms throw back whatever lands on them. I dropped a crate on one: it flew higher than the mast. Nobody wants to try first.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_3.name = Survey notes
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_3.description = Webs everywhere near the second survey mark. The spiders laid eggs in our crates. We left supplies at the white circle for those who follow.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_4.name = A letter never sent
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_4.description = If you read this, Dessa, don't let Thess go any deeper. There is something beneath the jade wall. You can hear it breathe when the cannons fall quiet.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_5.name = Quartermaster's journal
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_5.description = The naga took the third camp. They speak of a Scythe who dreams beneath the chasm and promises them the sea. Dolus has listened to their songs for too long.
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_6.name = Last page
items.Nakasar_Fractal_Sailor_Journal_6.description = Dolus looked at us and his eyes were no longer his own. Do not look at him. Never look at the Visage. Kanaxai waits below, and he hungers.
